---
// src/components/Mission.astro
---
<section id="mission" class="py-20 bg-bg-secondary">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary">Our Mission & Values</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-text-secondary max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      We believe in nurturing youth wellbeing through meaningful connections to community and earth, fostering deep relationships that support both our children's growth and our planet's health.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-12 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-bg-primary p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Earth Connection</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-text-secondary">
          Helping students and families develop deep, meaningful relationships with the natural world through hands-on experiences.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-bg-primary p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Community Engagement</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-text-secondary">
          Building strong connections between families, schools, and local organizations to create lasting positive change.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-bg-primary p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Youth Wellbeing</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-text-secondary">
          Nurturing the whole child - their physical, mental, emotional, and spiritual wellbeing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>